  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Raspberry_Muffin.png/revision/latest?cb=20240205074215\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Raspberry muffin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Raspberry muffin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Raspberry muffin</figcaption></figure> \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 19</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 140</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  45 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Bakery</span><span title=\"Bakery\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bakery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"54\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 39</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">38 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Raspberry muffins</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 19.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making raspberry muffins</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/47/Bakery.png/revision/latest?cb=20260810195925\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bakery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"139\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Bakery</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Raspberry muffins are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a>.\n</p><p>To make a muffin, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Eggs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Eggs\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/raspberry-2243\" title=\"Raspberries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Raspberries\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 45 minutes to make one muffin, and 38 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> Bakery. Each muffin gives players 17 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling raspberry muffins</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Raspberry muffins can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,404 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 muffins.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make a muffin costs 114 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 4 raspberry muffins per crate, up to a total of 12 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Video</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox video video-thumbnail xsmall\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AThe_Hay_Day_Kitchen_The_Raspberry_Muffin\" title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen The Raspberry Muffin (14 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"></span><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c8/The_Hay_Day_Kitchen_The_Raspberry_Muffin/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180902201008\" title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen The Raspberry Muffin (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen The Raspberry Muffin (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"title\">The Hay Day Kitchen The Raspberry Muffin</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-bakery-products-7554\" title=\"Category:Bakery Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/banana-bread-26412\" title=\"Banana Bread\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Banana Bread\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/blackberry-muffin-2295\" title=\"Blackberry Muffin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blackberry Muffin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/blueberry-muffin-36424\" title=\"Blueberry Muffin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueberry Muffin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bread-2084\" title=\"Bread\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bread\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cookie-2085\" title=\"Cookie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cookie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/corn-bread-2090\" title=\"Corn Bread\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Corn Bread\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di 